error BYN7010: `push` declares `becomes .open` but takes `this is .shut`; a transition needs
`ref this`

  7 │     void push(this is .shut) becomes .open {
    │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    │
  help: change the receiver of `push` to `ref this`, or return the new state as a value
    │ 7 │     void push(ref this is .shut) becomes .open {
    │   │               ++++

